# Local PROXY_IP rules (highest priority, one per line, '#' starts a comment).
# Lists that upstream keeps changing (Cloudflare / Telegram / Google / GitHub)
# are fetched by the workflow and do not belong here; only hand-maintained
# ranges go into this file.

# Apple's officially published core ranges
# (IPv4 plus three IPv6 ranges, see support.apple.com/en-us/103229)
IP-CIDR,17.0.0.0/8
IP-CIDR6,2403:300::/32
IP-CIDR6,2620:149::/32
IP-CIDR6,2a01:b740::/32

# Apple media/service ranges from older versions of that document
# (RDAP: Apple Inc. / Claris; keep them only if you need them)
IP-CIDR,63.92.224.0/19
IP-CIDR,65.199.22.0/23
IP-CIDR,139.178.128.0/18
IP-CIDR,144.178.0.0/19
IP-CIDR,144.178.36.0/22
IP-CIDR,144.178.48.0/20
IP-CIDR,192.35.50.0/24
IP-CIDR,198.183.17.0/24
IP-CIDR,205.180.175.0/24
IP-CIDR6,2a01:b747::/32

